<p>Shah jab lasha e besheer ko haatho pe liye<br> haye maidaan se khaimo ki taraf jane lage<br> raah mein saath qadam aage badhe piche hate<br> apne zaanu pe phir asghar ka janaza rakhke<br> kaise shabbir ne dil apna sambhala hoga<br> teer jab gardan e asghar se nikala hoga</p> 
<p>Khaich kar teer phir ek baar shahe deen chale<br> laash uthaye hue jab khaime ke darr par pohche<br> parda khaime ka hatate hue kuch der ruke<br> yaad jab aayi sakina to yeh kehkar palte<br> ghum se marjaegi jab saamne aayegi bahan<br> bhai ka zakhmi gala dekh na payegi bahan</p> 
<p>Aagaye laasha liye khaimo ke piche shahe dee'n<br> bole asghar ki taraf dekh kar aye mere hasee'n&nbsp;<br> kaash ke hum bhi tere saath hi mar jate wahi'n<br> haye itna to tujhe teer ne bhi maara nahi'n<br> ran mein maara hai tujhe garm hawa ne jitna<br> muh khula tha pyaasa tha na jaane kitna</p> 
<p>Shiddat e dhoop wo, sehra ki tapish loo ki chubhan<br> qabr talwar se jab khod chuke shah e zaman<br> roke kehne lage, phaila ke abaa ka daman<br> kaha'n ye jalti zamee'n aur kaha'n nazuk sa badan<br> kabhi chooma kabhi seene se lagaya laasha<br> baap ne qabr mein rakh rakh ke uthaya laasha</p> 
<p>Ya Ali kehke jo phir qabr mein laasha rakha<br> maa na aajaye kai baar ye uth kar dekha<br> paon ki simt se tadfeen ka aghaz kiya<br> tan chupate hue jab hath gale tak pohcha<br> bosa besheer ki gardan ka badi der liya<br> khaak mein chehra chupate hue muh pher liya</p> 
<p>Sar chadhaye gaye jab naizo pe ek sar na mila<br> khaak mein naiza gadhate hue zalim nikla<br> dhundhte dhundhte wo khaimo ke piche pohcha<br> maar kar naiza jo khaicha to badan saath aaya<br> run mein jab umme rabab aaye yeh manzar dekha<br> apne bachhe ka badan nok e sina par dekha</p> 
<p>Haye zeeshan O raza zulm yaha'n bhi na ruka<br> jab tadapte hue besheer ke maa ko dekha<br> usne naize se banda khaich ke matti pe rakha<br> saamne maa ke gala kaat diya asghar ka<br> ye la'ee jaane, ye maa jaane, ya jaane asghar<br> naiza us sar mein piroya tha, ya phir naize mein sar..</p>